id bvwm-tile-desk-prev
group x11-wm/bvwm
label Send to previous desktop
chord Super+Ctrl+comma
enabled 0
enabled 1 bvwm
session 0
session 1 bvwm
command Current TileSendDesk prev
repeat 0
greeter 0
listen 0
desc Send the focused window to the previous pager cell. Named desks are used when there is more than one. bvwm owns the key.
